      "content": "representation* in which $\\mathbf{q}_0$ is diagonal to that representation in which $\\mathbf{q}$ is diagonal. In the matrix scheme in which $\\mathbf{q}_0$ is diagonal, $\\mathbf{p}_0$ can be replaced by the operator $-i\\hbar\\partial/\\partial q_0$. According to Dirac [l.c. equation (11)] the desired transformation amplitude $S(q_0, q)$ satisfies the differential equation,",
